    "The capabilities of LLM-based AI agents become particularly powerful when they collaborate across organizational boundaries.",
    "Collaborating agents can accomplish tasks that exceed the capabilities of individual agents.",
    "An example is an agent assisting a user in planning a vacation by interacting with external agents from travel agencies, airlines, and hotels to execute the entire booking process autonomously.",
